# Store every file exactly as shipped, byte for byte.
#
# Each package carries SHA-256 manifests over its own files, and the CSV/JSON records are
# numerical evidence. Any end-of-line conversion would change those bytes on clone, so no
# text normalisation is applied to anything (`-text` disables EOL conversion and CRLF
# smuggling for all paths). Git detects binary content on its own.
* -text
